    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1076-a1">

                <pb facs="1164" n="1068" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1068"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 131.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American
                    League</hi></placeName>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Whereas we have learned with profound regret of the disaster to the battle ship
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Maine</hi> in the harbor of Habana on the evening of
                    February 15, 1898, and the terrible fate of 253 of our countrymen at that time:
                    Therefore be it.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Resolved</hi>, That the American League of Hawaii, as a
                    body and as 500 individual men, hereby express their deep sympathy for the
                    mother country in the disaster thus occasioned, and unite with her in lamenting
                    the destruction of the crew of the <hi rendition="#italic">Maine</hi> and the
                    vessel itself.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theo. P. Severin</hi>, <hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. B. Murry</hi>, <hi
                                    rendition="#italic">President.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hall of the
                            American League</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic">Honolulu,
                                H. I.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-03-02"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 2, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
